to=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5c98459d8cc763783d059f292a793075, https://si.imgix.net/ffa29c29/uploads/origins/c1645433-c799-40e5-9c87-7255166cda71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=56555ccbcde1501209e48d19754b76ad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ffa29c29/uploads/origins/c1645433-c799-40e5-9c87-7255166cda71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a634dda28758964465917fe6260fb087 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I love your drawing style and I think it is perfect for my original character. Could you please draw her for me?\n\n🕸️ Bali | 170 cm tall | 27 years old\n' The only youngest daughter of a wealthy businessman, she was adopted at the age of 9.\n' She is strict and noble, and maintains an elegant appearance. However, when spoken to or seen by others, she appears extremely kind and polite. She is very good at putting on an outward demeanor and has played the 'role' of the perfect filial daughter almost her entire life.\n' As a matter of fact, she was adopted by her current family only to be a 'sacrifice' in place of her own sons, her brothers. The family is wealthy, but is haunted by a demonic presence that will not rest until it has eradicated every single man of the family's blood.\n' Because her spirituality was similar to that of her adopted brothers, she was welcomed as their replacement. But surprisingly, she was supposed to be a one-time sacrifice, but survived the ritual - and continued to survive for years afterward.\n''The family does not consider her a true family member. They treat her as a mere sacrifice.\n' While her family treats her coldly, she has a strong attachment to one of the few friends who have been kind to her from the beginning.\n' She is a little too attached to this friend and tends to be extremely overprotective.\n' Her dark secret lies in how she survived the sacrificial ritual. She tore apart the demon that came to capture her with her bare hands and teeth and devoured it before it could devour itself. Because of this, evil energy flows in her blood, and she embraces it.\n' She has the special ability to briefly mimic the identity of the person who ingested her blood.\n\nMotifs: crows, crosses, lace, silver, shadows, picture frames, red footprints, spider webs.\n\nNotes on appearance:\n' He is originally 170 cm tall, but always wears high heels.\n' Her hair is usually tied in twin-tails, but sometimes let down.\n' She has three moles under her left eye.\n' Her eyes are a dull blue color with a white circle above the iris and a line running through it.\n' There is a scar on the left shoulder that looks like a claw mark of a large creature.\n\nThank you for your time. You may decline this request for any reason.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cW2fR_uK75OqjctfC-8-2tjBxRWGslrs?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ryu_Graffiti/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2106849, "client_id": 18708, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e75635af/uploads/origins/6118d15e-97d5-4b77-9dbf-a1d3e755280f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6295e0ad540569be15cb113bedc28b74", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e75635af/uploads/origins/6118d15e-97d5-4b77-9dbf-a1d3e755280f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6295e0ad540569be15cb113bedc28b74, https://si.imgix.net/e75635af/uploads/origins/6118d15e-97d5-4b77-9dbf-a1d3e755280f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a4d89157ea00afb73de3138dca9e597f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e75635af/uploads/origins/6118d15e-97d5-4b77-9dbf-a1d3e755280f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1cf5d99852ed3b2eddf82023da9309d0 3x